    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Studying",
     "texto": [
      "**Studiować** is mainly used for university studies and takes its object in the accusative: **Studiuję historię** («I study history»).",
      "**Uczyć się** means «to learn/study» in general and is also used for school learning."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "University student or school pupil",
     "texto": [
      "In Polish, **student** usually means a university student; **uczeń** is a school pupil.",
      "Don't translate both as «student» without checking the context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
